## 5. Verification & Post-Mortem Validation
* **Data Integrity Check:** Logged into the Immich web UI at `http://<primary_ai_server_ip>:2283`. Confirmed that the timeline, user accounts, albums, and historical metadata fully loaded without errors.
* **Mobile Sync Check:** Reconfigured the mobile application to point to the new host address on the primary AI server. Successfully ran a delta backup of new photos.
* **Status:** **Fully Operational.** (Note: Machine learning workloads and vector search tuning remain paused/unoptimized on the primary AI server, to be handled under the upcoming optimization initiative).
